msgstr "Shared secret"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:452
msgid "共有集計で高く見える応答"
msgstr "Response with the highest shared aggregate estimate"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:434
msgid "共有集計の参照"
msgstr "View Shared Aggregates"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:361
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:378
msgid "内容識別"
msgstr "Content ID"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:332
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1049
msgid "分類"
msgstr "Category"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:944
msgid "初回確認を完了しました。設定はいつでも変更できます。"
msgstr "Initial review completed. You can change the settings at any time."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:128
msgid "初期状態"
msgstr "Initial state"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:865
msgid "初期状態は観測のみ"
msgstr "Starts in Observation Only"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:129
msgid ""
"初期設定は「観測のみ」です。プラグインを有効化しただけでは、HTTPレスポンスを"
"変更しません。"
msgstr ""
"The initial setting is Observation Only. Activating the plugin alone does "
"not modify HTTP responses."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:257
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1100
msgid "判定不能"
msgstr "Indeterminate"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1098
msgid "別分類で継続"
msgstr "Continued under another category"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:141
msgid ""
"匿名共有は明示的なオプトイン後だけ行います。IP、URL、Cookie、本文、ドメインを"
"含まない匿名集計だけを扱います。"
msgstr ""
"Anonymous sharing occurs only after explicit opt-in. Only anonymous "
"aggregates without IP addresses, URLs, cookies, request bodies, or domains "
"are handled."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:710
msgid "匿名集計JSONをダウンロード"
msgstr "Download Anonymous Aggregate JSON"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:869
msgid "匿名集計の参照を有効にする"
msgstr "Enable viewing anonymous aggregates"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:231
msgid ""
"匿名集計の提供はオプトイン時だけ日次ジッターで送信します。集計参照は提供に参"
"加しなくても利用できます。"
msgstr ""
"Anonymous aggregates are sent daily with jitter only after opt-in. You can "
"view aggregates without contributing data."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:860
msgid ""
"参加しなくても、自分のサイトの状況確認と、集まった匿名集計データの参照は可能"
"です。"
msgstr ""
"Without participating, you can still review your site's status and view the "
"collected anonymous aggregate data."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:602
msgid ""
"参加しなくても集計の参照は可能です。提供する場合も、IP、URL、Cookie、本文、ド"
"メインは送信しません。"
msgstr ""
"You can view aggregates without participating. Even when contributing, no IP "
"addresses, URLs, cookies, request bodies, or domains are sent."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:437
msgid "参照停止中"
msgstr "Viewing disabled"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:437
msgid "参照有効"
msgstr "Viewing enabled"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1252
msgid "取得失敗"
msgstr "Fetch failed"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:600
msgid "各クライアントが共有した匿名集計を参照する"
msgstr "View anonymous aggregates shared by clients"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:435
msgid ""
"各クライアントが提供した匿名集計を読み出します。中央からコード、強制遮断、強"
"制設定は受け取りません。"
msgstr ""
"Retrieves anonymous aggregates contributed by clients. No code, forced "
"blocking, or forced settings are received from the central service."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:302
